  "question": {
    "text": "For a complex number <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Z</mi></math>, if the argument of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>Z</mi><mo>-</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> are equal, then the maximum distance of <math><mi>Z</mi></math> from the&nbsp;<math><mi>x</mi></math>-axis is equal to (where, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>)"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> units",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn></math> units",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> units",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> units",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let,&nbsp;<math><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></math><br />Now,&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mo>-</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>Z</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mo>-</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mo>-</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> of <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>where</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Centre of the circle is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> and radius <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0067_be5657a4ce7f.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:2.12708in;height:1.27986in\" /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> required value <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;units</p>"
  }
